(text "RMX B1 / 5V CONSUMER-LEVEL AUDIO / ENGINEERING DRAFT - not a +24dBu interface" (at 15 13 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left)) (uuid 967ff3c4-8f2b-52de-8168-4ede8dce0d70))
(text "Regulated 5V/1A external source; never 12V. RCA only, shared unbalanced ground. Nominal -10dBV, recommended peak programme level <=1Vrms." (at 15 17 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left)) (uuid 98ff12f0-2175-5df8-90ec-7995ed21537f))
(text "TLV9064 input buffers and output gain share a filtered midrail. Trim unity with the actual Rev7 codec and >=10k load." (at 15 21 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left)) (uuid c45bd3c2-785a-5aa4-a3f5-28e399c0b2e7))
(text "Current limiting / rail clamps do not constitute certified ESD or overload survival. Qualify powered/unpowered injection and power sequencing." (at 15 25 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left)) (uuid abefa4c7-8c22-5d8b-aa75-d56af76766e2))
(text "Service USB cable MUST block VBUS; otherwise the Seed USB supply bypasses SW34 and the unit cannot be fully switched off." (at 15 29 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left)) (uuid 581296cf-b267-5d61-8c80-c728a467eb06))
